# A finished turn, then Tern's themes changing under it: the Hermes theme is lifted (it is a
# stylesheet here), five of Tern's own follow, and the Hermes theme comes back.
#   render.py turn --start 68.2 --seconds 3.6 --events offline/themes.events --name themes-dark
0.40 css zz-hermes
0.40 theme dark "dark-dracula"
0.90 theme dark "dark-tokyo-night"
1.40 theme dark "dark-gruvbox"
1.90 theme dark "dark-rose-pine"
2.40 theme dark "dark-nord"
2.90 theme dark "titanium"
2.90 css zz-hermes {here}/../themes/hermes-dark.css
